# docs-skills — Documentation Analysis

This project includes 11 documentation analysis skills in .cursor/rules/docs-skills.mdc.

When the user mentions docs-analyze, docs-seo, docs-accessibility, docs-i18n, docs-style-tone,
docs-audience, docs-navigation-linking, docs-content-types, docs-structure-templates,
docs-media, or docs-maintenance — apply the corresponding skill definition.

These skills use the Docsbook MCP server (mcp__docsbook__*) to read documentation graphs
from any public GitHub repository without cloning locally.

MCP setup: mcp add --transport http https://docsbook.io/api/mcp/server
